        <mxCell id="48mQKfHj96o4jcNBYrxQ-16" parent="48mQKfHj96o4jcNBYrxQ-14" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;1. L’utente clicca sul pulsante “Login”.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;2. Il Sistema mostra a video la schermata di login contenente il pulsante “Entra con SPID/eIDAS”&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;3. L’utente clicca sul pulsante “Entra con SPID/eIDAS”.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;4. Il Sistema mostra a video un menu a tendina contenente l&#39;elenco dei Provider disponibili.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;5. L’utente seleziona il proprio Provider cliccando sull&#39;apposito pulsante .&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;6. L’utente inserisce le proprie credenziali nel form e clicca sul pulsante “Conferma”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;7. Il sistema richiede al provider l&#39;esito dell&#39;autenticazione&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;8. Il Provider invia l’esito dell’autenticazione al Sistema.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;9. SE l’esito è negativo:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;9.1. Il Sistema mostra a video il messaggio di errore: “Accesso Negato”.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;9&lt;/span&gt;.2. L’utente clicca sul pulsante “ok” per chiuderlo.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;9.3. Il Sistema mostra nuovamente la schermata di login.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;10. ALTRIMENTI (Esito positivo):&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;10.&lt;/span&gt;1. Il Sistema interroga il DBMS per verificare i dati dell&#39;account.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;10&lt;/span&gt;.2. Il Sistema mostra a video la schermata “Home AFAM”&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="390" width="580" x="380" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="390" width="580" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
