        <mxCell id="48mQKfHj96o4jcNBYrxQ-33" parent="48mQKfHj96o4jcNBYrxQ-20" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="470" width="960" y="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="48mQKfHj96o4jcNBYrxQ-34" parent="48mQKfHj96o4jcNBYrxQ-33" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Flusso degli eventi&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="470" width="380" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="470" width="380" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="48mQKfHj96o4jcNBYrxQ-35" parent="48mQKfHj96o4jcNBYrxQ-33" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;1. L’utente clicca sul pulsante “Login”.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;2. Il Sistema mostra a video la schermata di login contenente il form (Email, Password) e il pulsante “Accedi”.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;3. L’utente compila i campi con Email e Password e clicca sul pulsante “Accedi”.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;4. Il Sistema interroga il DBMS per verificare la presenza e la correttezza dei dati inseriti.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;5. SE le credenziali non sono corrette:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;5.1. Il Sistema mostra a video il messaggio di errore: “Credenziali non corrette”.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;5.2. L’utente clicca sul pulsante “ok” per chiuderlo.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;5.3. Il Sistema mostra nuovamente la schermata di login.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;6. ALTRIMENTI (Credenziali corrette - Inizio verifica 2FA):&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;6.1. Il Sistema genera un codice di verifica e lo invia all’e-mail dello studente.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;6.2. Il Sistema mostra a video la schermata “Verifica Identità” (campo Codice).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;6.3. L’utente inserisce il codice ricevuto e clicca sul pulsante “Verifica”.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;6.4. Il Sistema valida il codice inserito.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;6.5. SE il codice di verifica è errato:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 6.5.1. Il Sistema mostra a video il messaggio di errore: “Codice errato”.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 6.5.2. L’utente clicca sul pulsante “Invia nuovo codice”.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 6.5.3. Il Sistema genera un nuovo codice, lo invia all’e-mail dello studente e ricarica la schermata di verifica.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;6.6. Altrimenti( il codice di verifica è corretto):&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 6.6.1. Il Sistema richiede al DBMS i dati relativi all’Account.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 6.6.2. Il Sistema mostra a video la schermata “Home AFAM”.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="470" width="580" x="380" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="470" width="580" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
