        <mxCell id="NjzHbujkAoP8RgKD8_Af-16" parent="NjzHbujkAoP8RgKD8_Af-14" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;align=left;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente clicca sul pulsante &quot;GESTIONE PORTFOLIO&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt; Il Sistema recupera dalla memoria i dati dello studente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Il Sistema mostra a video la schermata &quot;Gestione Portfolio&quot; contenente i dati &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;   &lt;/span&gt;attuali dello studente (Scuola/Università frequentata, Collaborazioni fatte, &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;   &lt;/span&gt;Collaborazioni con autori, Partecipazione in canzoni famose) e il pulsante &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;   &lt;/span&gt;&quot;Modifica Dati&quot;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente clicca sul pulsante &quot;Modifica Dati&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;5&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema mostra a video il form di modifica con i campi editabili.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;6&lt;/b&gt;. L&#39;utente inserisce i nuovi dati .&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;7&lt;/b&gt;. L&#39;utente clicca sul pulsante &quot;Conferma Modifiche&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;8&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema invia i nuovi dati aggiornati al DBMS per la sovrascrittura permanente &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;sul database.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;9. &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;Il sistema aggiorna i dati dello studente in memoria&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;10&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema mostra a video il messaggio di conferma: &quot;Modifiche effettuate &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;   &lt;/span&gt;correttamente&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;11&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente clicca sul pulsante &quot;ok&quot; per chiudere il messaggio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;12&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema mostra nuovamente la schermata &quot;Gestione Portfolio&quot; aggiornata con i &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; nuovi valori.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
