        <mxCell id="rBFPTPXUp2qlC89oPuT--15" parent="rBFPTPXUp2qlC89oPuT--14" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Flusso degli eventi&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="590" width="380" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="590" width="380" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rBFPTPXUp2qlC89oPuT--16" parent="rBFPTPXUp2qlC89oPuT--14" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;1. Lo studente clicca sul pulsante &quot;Ricerca studente 🔍&quot;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;2. &lt;/span&gt;Il sistema mostra a video una schermata dove poter inserire nome e cognome e &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;    &lt;/span&gt;il pulsante &quot;Conferma Condivisione Finale&quot;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;3. &lt;/span&gt;Finché&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;lo studente non decide di procedere con la condivisione:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;3.1. Lo studente digita il nome e cognome di un altro studente AFAM nella &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;       &lt;/span&gt;barra di ricerca.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;3.2. Lo studente clicca sul pulsante &quot;Cerca&quot;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;3.3. Il sistema interagisce con il DBMS per verificare la presenza dello &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;       &lt;/span&gt;studente cercato.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;3.4.&amp;nbsp;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;336&quot;&gt;SE&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;la ricerca non va a buon fine (nessun risultato trovato):&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;3.4.1. Il sistema mostra a video il messaggio di errore: &quot;Nessun &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;  &lt;/span&gt;risultato trovato&quot;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;3.4.2. Lo studente clicca su &quot;OK&quot; sul messaggio di errore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;3.4.3. Il sistema mostra nuovamente la barra di ricerca vuota.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;3.5.&amp;nbsp;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;609&quot;&gt;ALTRIMENTI&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;(lo studente cercato esiste):&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;3.5.1. Il sistema mostra a video lo studente cercato con una casellina &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;  &lt;/span&gt;(checkbox) accanto al nome.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;3.5.2. Lo studente spunta la checkbox relativa allo studente individuato. &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;3.5.3. Il sistema salva in memoria temporanea lo studente selezionato, &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;  &lt;/span&gt;aggiungendolo alla lista dei destinatari visibile a schermo.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;3.5.4. Lo studente svuota la barra di ricerca per cercare un altro nome.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;4. &lt;/span&gt;Lo studente clicca sul pulsante &quot;Conferma Condivisione Finale&quot;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;5. &lt;/span&gt;Il sistema mostra a video il messaggio informativo:&amp;nbsp;&lt;i data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;52&quot;&gt;&quot;Selezionando questa &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;    &lt;/span&gt;opzione permetterai agli studenti selezionati di accedere al file impostato con &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;    &lt;/span&gt;privacy privata, CONFERMI?&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;con le opzioni &quot;SI&quot; e &quot;NO&quot;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;6. &lt;/span&gt;SE&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;lo studente clicca su &quot;NO&quot;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;6.1. Il sistema svuota la memoria temporanea.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;6.2. Il sistema mostra a video il file che lo studente voleva condividere &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;       &lt;/span&gt;(annullamento operazione).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;7. &lt;/span&gt;ALTRIMENTI&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;(lo studente clicca su &quot;SI&quot;):&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;7.1. Il sistema interagisce con il DBMS per salvare i permessi di accesso per &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;       &lt;/span&gt;gli studenti selezionati.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;7.2. Il sistema mostra a video un messaggio di conferma: &quot;CONDIVISIONE &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;       &lt;/span&gt;CONFERMATA&quot;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;7.3. Lo studente clicca su &quot;OK&quot; sul messaggio.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;7.4. Il sistema mostra a video la propria area personale con tutti gli strumenti &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;       &lt;/span&gt;e i file caricati.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="590" width="420" x="380" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="590" width="420" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
